{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-pulitang","title":"严密建丹杨湖田浦里塘、兴力主可成、就作劳民","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-d29866f570a0e9d430d9","label":"正文","text":"永安三年都尉严密建丹杨湖田作浦里塘；诏百官会议咸以为用功多田不保成，唯兴以为可成；遂会诸兵民就作，功佣之费不可胜数，士卒死亡或自贼杀，百姓大怨之","evidence":["santizhu064-q-68bb539aae1f98bac08e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0042","role":"建丹杨湖田作浦里塘（都尉）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-68bb539aae1f98bac08e"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0048","role":"力主可成并主持就作","evidence":["santizhu064-q-68bb539aae1f98bac08e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-68bb539aae1f98bac08e"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-68bb539aae1f98bac08e","source_order":[64,533,0],"order":11050}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0042","name":"严密","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"santizhu-p0048","name":"濮阳兴","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu064-q-68bb539aae1f98bac08e","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-5e7cef985b4af30aa617","layer":"original","quote":"永安三年，都尉严密建丹杨湖田，作浦里塘。诏百官会议，咸以为“用功多而田不保成”，唯兴以为“可成”。遂会诸兵民就作，功佣之费不可胜数；士卒死亡，或自贼杀〖6〗：百姓大怨之。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":532,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":44,"end":129}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
